{"4587980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veil", "steam_appid": 4587980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/ed1c89377e591489b3ba4262d47e42b1.poster.avif?t=1779942026\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/ed1c89377e591489b3ba4262d47e42b1.webm?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/ed1c89377e591489b3ba4262d47e42b1.mp4?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VEIL is a first-person psychological horror game about exploration, atmosphere, and the fear of what remains hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weekend trip to a remote island slowly turns into something far more disturbing. You play as Tung, traveling with a group of friends in search of a quiet escape — but from the moment you arrive, the island feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar places begin to twist, strange events pile up, and the line between memory, fear, and reality starts to blur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SLOW-BURN HORROR EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around slow tension and environmental storytelling, VEIL uses dark interiors, carefully framed moments, and unsettling silence to create a grounded horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/b226d8900f21fe9ce4252f9e84c6337c.poster.avif?t=1779942026\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/b226d8900f21fe9ce4252f9e84c6337c.webm?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/b226d8900f21fe9ce4252f9e84c6337c.mp4?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE UNKNOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, inspect objects, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover the events behind the haunting. Progress depends on observation, curiosity, and your willingness to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/8c1502edc020ba13053f57b0d2258d2a.poster.avif?t=1779942026\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/8c1502edc020ba13053f57b0d2258d2a.webm?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/8c1502edc020ba13053f57b0d2258d2a.mp4?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUND, LIGHT, AND FEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distant noises, flickering lights, fog, and oppressive silence work together to keep you uneasy. The horror is not only what you see, but what you think might be waiting nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/a6612e7926bd331a02a1cf2aaf559b3e.avif?t=1779942026\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FOCUSED INDIE HORROR STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo indie developer, VEIL offers a short horror experience focused on atmosphere, mystery, fear, and unsettling moments throughout the journey.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/ed1c89377e591489b3ba4262d47e42b1.poster.avif?t=1779942026\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/ed1c89377e591489b3ba4262d47e42b1.webm?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/ed1c89377e591489b3ba4262d47e42b1.mp4?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VEIL is a first-person psychological horror game about exploration, atmosphere, and the fear of what remains hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weekend trip to a remote island slowly turns into something far more disturbing. You play as Tung, traveling with a group of friends in search of a quiet escape — but from the moment you arrive, the island feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar places begin to twist, strange events pile up, and the line between memory, fear, and reality starts to blur.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SLOW-BURN HORROR EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around slow tension and environmental storytelling, VEIL uses dark interiors, carefully framed moments, and unsettling silence to create a grounded horror atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/b226d8900f21fe9ce4252f9e84c6337c.poster.avif?t=1779942026\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/b226d8900f21fe9ce4252f9e84c6337c.webm?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/b226d8900f21fe9ce4252f9e84c6337c.mp4?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE UNKNOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues, inspect objects, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover the events behind the haunting. Progress depends on observation, curiosity, and your willingness to keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/8c1502edc020ba13053f57b0d2258d2a.poster.avif?t=1779942026\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/8c1502edc020ba13053f57b0d2258d2a.webm?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/8c1502edc020ba13053f57b0d2258d2a.mp4?t=1779942026\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUND, LIGHT, AND FEAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distant noises, flickering lights, fog, and oppressive silence work together to keep you uneasy. The horror is not only what you see, but what you think might be waiting nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4587980/extras/a6612e7926bd331a02a1cf2aaf559b3e.avif?t=1779942026\" width=616 height=353 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FOCUSED INDIE HORROR STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by a solo indie developer, VEIL offers a short horror experience focused on atmosphere, mystery, fear, and unsettling moments throughout the journey.</p>", "short_description": "VEIL is a first-person psychological